  "resolution": {
    "change": "patches/llvm-mos/0060-llvm-reduce-parallel-mir.patch",
    "causal_explanation": "The parallel path serialized MIR work items as LLVM IR bitcode. Reconstructing from bitcode left MachineModuleInfo null, so the MIR instruction reducer dereferenced it. MIR workers now clone the machine functions and carry their MachineModuleInfo to the result; IR workers retain separate LLVM contexts and the bitcode path.",
